# 行尾统一为 LF
#
# 本机全局 core.autocrlf=true，git 每次 add 都会提示 "LF will be replaced by CRLF"。
# 那个设置是给"只写 Windows 代码"的人用的；本项目是 Rust + TS 的混合工程，
# 源码在 Windows 与 Linux 之间流转，行尾必须统一，否则每次跨平台 checkout
# 都会产生满屏的假 diff。这里显式钉死 LF，覆盖 core.autocrlf。

* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows 批处理的例外：cmd.exe 解析 CRLF 更稳，改了反而会出问题
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

# 二进制文件：不做行尾转换，也不参与 diff / merge
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif  binary
*.webp binary
*.bmp  binary
*.ico  binary
*.icns binary
*.ttf  binary
*.otf  binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.zip  binary
*.7z   binary
*.gz   binary
*.exe  binary
*.dll  binary
*.so   binary
*.dylib binary

# 本机运行时数据与锁文件（万一被误加进仓库，也不要让 git 尝试合并）
*.db     binary
*.db-shm binary
*.db-wal binary
Cargo.lock  -diff
package-lock.json  -diff

# 让 GitHub / 各类 diff 视图认得这些是生成产物
dist/**  linguist-generated
